OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Foccasional outbreaks of light rain and
OL,7,Fdrizzle for much of the night,
OL,8,Falthough the odd clear spell cannot be
OL,9,Fruled out. Winds strengthening ahead
OL,10,Fof a band of locally heavy rain,
OL,11,Fperhaps reaching the Peak District
OL,12,Faround dawn.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTuesday:FBlustery rainband, locally
OL,15,Fheavy, moves east through the morning,
OL,16,Fbefore clearing by midday. Sunny
OL,17,Fspells follow, and just the odd light
OL,18,Fshower in the north. Staying breezy
OL,19,Fand feeling mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
